  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A certain element crystallises in a bcc lattice of unit cell edge length 27 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mover></math>. If the same element under the same conditions crystallises in the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>fcc</mi></math> lattice, the edge length of the unit cell in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mover></math> will be __________. (Round off to the Nearest Integer).</p><p>[Assume each lattice point has a single atom]</p><p>[Assume <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>73</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>41</mn></math>]</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "33",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>BCC</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math></p><p>so&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>27</mn></math></p><p>for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>FCC</mi><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>27</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>27</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>33</mn></math></p>",
